>1983001003</doc-number><kind>A1</kind></document-id><sources><source category="Y"  name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="WO-1986002001-A1" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>WO</country><doc-number>1986002001</doc-number><kind>A1</kind> </document-id><sources><source category="Y" name="SEA"  created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="WO-1990002555-A1"  status="new"><document-id status="new"  format="epo"><country>WO</country><doc-number>1990002555</doc-number> <kind>A1</kind> </document-id> <sources><source category="X" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="WO-1998047359-A1" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>WO</country><doc-number>1998047359</doc-number><kind>A1</kind></document-id><sources><source category="Y" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit></patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KOIKE TETSUO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ROHTO PHARMA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TSUJIMOTO MICHIKO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOIKE, TETSUO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ROHTO PHARMACEUTICAL CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TSUJIMOTO, MICHIKO</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KOIKE TETSUO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TSUJIMOTO MICHIKO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOIKE, TETSUO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TSUJIMOTO, MICHIKO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>Polymers containing an alkylene having hydroxy in its main chain and a quaternary ammonium salt which show bactericidal and fungicidal effects at a concentration not damaging human cells, are not irritating to eye and never absorbed, adsorbed or accumulated in moisture-containing contact lenses. Owing to these characteristics, the above polymers are highly useful as detergents, antiseptics or preservatives for contact lenses. In addition, these compounds are highly hydrophilic and impart adequate moistness to contact lenses which thus give a favorable feel in using without any irritation to eyes.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Cette invention se rapporte à des polymères contenant un alkylène comportant hydroxy dans sa chaîne principale et un sel d'ammonium quaternaire. Ces polymères possèdent des effets bactéricides et fongicides à une concentration n'endommageant pas les cellules humaines, ils n'irritent pas les yeux et ils n'ont pas tendance a être absorbés, a être adsorbés ou à s'accumuler dans les lentilles de contact hydrophiles. En raison de ces caractéristiques, ces polymères sont très utiles comme détergents, antiseptiques ou agents de conservation pour lentilles de contact. Ces composés sont en outre fortement hydrophiles et ils confèrent aux lentilles de contact une humidité adéquate, ce qui procure une sensation d'utilisation favorable sans irriter les yeux.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and int